# An allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is named here, so a local folder
# (another checkout, editor or machine settings) can never reach an image build or its cache.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!rust-toolchain.toml
!src/
!migrations/
!.sqlx/
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
